<title>USA: MYR Group to buy D.W. Close.</title>
<headline>MYR Group to buy D.W. Close.</headline>
<dateline>ROLLING MEADOWS, Ill. 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>MYR Group Inc said Thursday it signed a letter of intent to acquire Seattle-based D.W. Close Co Inc.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
<p>D.W. Close is an electrical contracting firm with revenues in the $25 million to $30 million range.</p>
<p>The transaction is expected to be completed in the first quarter of 1997, the company said.</p>
<p>MYR Group provides electrical and telecommunications construction services.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
